# Keep the build context small and the image reproducible: everything below is either rebuilt inside
# the container, irrelevant to it, or must not travel into an image at all.
**/bin/
**/obj/
node_modules/
test-results/
publish-test/
.git/
.github/
**/.claude/
.vs/
*.ps1
*.md
!README.md

# Real API keys and database credentials. Never in an image, and never sent to a daemon either.
# The **/ matters: dev-secrets.json lives in GraphDBViewerWeb/wwwroot, and a bare name only matches at
# the root of the context, where the file never is, so the bare name this used to be excluded nothing.
**/dev-secrets.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
